5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery. I want to be sure the room can handle things.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips. We need to know what actually draws people back.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look at the conservation lab staffing and backlog and the composition of the volunteer roster! We need to know who is actually working!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays! I bet that's where the delays happen!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent start. I shall investigate the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate. I suspect the budget leaks are quite specific.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
