26,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The suspended bay has a weight limit, and the evening hires mean we have caterers moving through. We can't have things in the way that can't be moved.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"It seems the public prefers movement and human presence. Static, cased objects don't encourage repeat visits as much as active displays or people.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Rin,,The conservation lab is almost empty! There's a huge backlog of stuff waiting to be cleaned. And most of our volunteers are just the history circle.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"I knew it! Paperwork from distant lenders is making us miss shipping dates. Also, powered displays keep breaking and forcing us to rope off areas!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"As I feared, transport and insurance are eating a third of our installation budget. Meanwhile, the cost of bespoke mounts is skyrocketing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Kenji, if powered displays are breaking, that sounds like a lot of stress for the floor staff.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, if the lab is understaffed, any exhibition requiring heavy conservation work will be a disaster.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, exactly! We can't just assume the lab can handle a big project right now.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if transport is that expensive, maybe we should look for something more local?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, a most astute observation. Local sourcing would certainly stem the bleeding of our financial reserves.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, and if we avoid bespoke mounts, we might save more.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"We must balance the budget with the visitor experience. If we go too safe, the gallery remains empty.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Rin,,But we can't do anything if there's no one to actually set it up or clean the objects!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Kenji,,And we can't have the gallery roped off because a motor died! That's just embarrassing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears we are facing a trifecta of fragility: financial, operational, and technical.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
